  "summary": "Verifies the base64 signature against the utf8 representation of *message*",
  "description": "The .verify() function verifies the base64 signature against the utf8 representation of message using the CryptoKey object keys and provided options.\n\nThe CryptoKey must contain a valid public key.",
  "docPage": "mirror/docs/21-R3/API/CryptoKeyClass.html",
  "overloads": [
